<article class="env-lemma" id="02M7">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/02M7">Lemma <span data-tag="02M7">10.67.3</span>.</a> Let $R$ be a Noetherian ring. Let $M$ be a finite $R$-module. For any $f \in R$ we have $(M')_ f = (M_ f)'$ where $M \to M'$ and $M_ f \to (M_ f)'$ are the quotients constructed in Lemma <a href="/tag/02M6" data-tag="02M6">10.67.2</a>. </p>
